    "ego": {
        "_comment": "PICO ego streaming capture. Run adb reverse tcp:50051 tcp:50051 on Ubuntu, then launch the PICO app with EgoStreamingClientController. timeCalibrate estimates Pico-to-host clock offset before START. softAlignToOrbbecFirstFrame is the older Orbbec-first-frame alignment and is off by default. cameraParamsPath is the fixed calibrated ego parameter JSON copied into each episode.",
