        "_comment": "Shroom/JQ tactile glove collection, matching tactile/record_tactile.py: continuous serial stream, header AA 55 03 99, packet 1 + packet 2 -> 256 uint8 pressure channels plus 16 raw IMU bytes. Both gloves are saved under each episode's touch/ directory and aligned in timestamps.csv.",
